{"seq":1,"slug":"vectorized-engine-architecture","title":"向量化引擎架构与实现选型（DuckDB/Velox/ClickHouse）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/engine-implementation-ops/vectorized-engine-architecture","wordCount":2651,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"向量化引擎架构与实现选型-duckdb-velox-clickhouse\">向量化引擎架构与实现选型（DuckDB/Velox/ClickHouse）</h1><p>同一个列式执行理论，落到工程上会分裂成三种完全不同的产物：DuckDB 是一个可被 <code>pip install</code> 进进程的嵌入式库，Velox 是一套供别人搭引擎的算子库与驱动框架，ClickHouse 是一台自带存储引擎的独立服务器。本文解释这三者的架构分岔点——向量尺寸、驱动方向、表达式求值方式、内存所有权、扩展接口——以及在这些约束下如何做选型。它承接 <a href=\"../execution-model-evolution/push-vectorized-execution\">推送式批处理与向量化执行模型</a> 的理论，聚焦「谁来跑、跑在哪儿、边界在哪」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>向量化引擎</strong>指的是：算子一次处理一整个<strong>列向批次</strong>（向量/块），而非一行的执行器。它的收益来自把逐行解释的固定开销摊薄到一个批次上。设批次大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，每批的调度与解释固定开销为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>dispatch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{dispatch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispatch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，逐行的有效计算成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>per-row</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{per-row}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">per-row</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 行的单行摊销成本为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>row</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>dispatch</mtext></msub><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>per-row</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{row}} = \\frac{C_{\\text{dispatch}}}{b} + c_{\\text{per-row}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">row</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispatch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">per-row</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子解释了工程上所有向量尺寸的取舍：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 增大时固定开销项被压低，但工作集溢出一级缓存、尾批次（不足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的残余行）与选择向量的掩码开销又反噬收益。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是「一阶权衡」，不存在普适最优值——三个引擎各自选了不同的数。</p>\n<p><strong>驱动方向</strong>决定控制权在谁手里：<strong>拉取式（pull）</strong> 是父算子向上索取下一批（Volcano 的批处理版），<strong>推送式（push）</strong> 是子算子主动把数据交给下游。围绕这条线的详细对比见 <a href=\"../execution-model-evolution/volcano-iterator-model\">火山模型与迭代器</a>。DuckDB 是 push 式，Velox 与 ClickHouse 更接近「pull 到算子、push 进流水线」的混合形态。</p>\n<p><strong>引擎的边界</strong>是第三个概念，也是选型的第一问：这个引擎是<strong>跑在你的进程里</strong>（嵌入式）、<strong>编译进你的二进制</strong>（库化），还是<strong>跑在另一台机器的进程里</strong>（服务化）？三者对内存所有权、并发模型、升级方式、观测手段的要求完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>DuckDB</th>\n<th>Velox</th>\n<th>ClickHouse</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交付形态</td>\n<td>嵌入式库（进程内）</td>\n<td>C++ 算子库 + 驱动框架</td>\n<td>独立服务端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储引擎</td>\n<td>自带（列存 + Parquet/Arrow 扫描）</td>\n<td><strong>不含</strong>（依赖调用方）</td>\n<td>自带 MergeTree 家族</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列向载体</td>\n<td>自有 Vector</td>\n<td>Arrow 兼容 <code>FlatVector</code></td>\n<td><code>Block</code>/<code>Column</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认批大小</td>\n<td>向量 2048 行</td>\n<td>调用方配置（常见 1k–10k）</td>\n<td>块 65536 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驱动方向</td>\n<td>push</td>\n<td>pull + 向量批次</td>\n<td>pull 到算子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达式求值</td>\n<td>向量化算子树 + 部分 JIT</td>\n<td>向量化表达式 + codegen 可插</td>\n<td>向量化函数 + SIMD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要语言</td>\n<td>C++</td>\n<td>C++</td>\n<td>C++</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用法</td>\n<td>单机分析、笔记本、ETL</td>\n<td>Presto/Trino/Spark-Gluten 的执行层</td>\n<td>自建集群 OLAP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DuckDB 的 <code>STANDARD_VECTOR_SIZE = 2048</code> 与其行组上限（约 12 万行）是文档化的常量（DuckDB 文档 <em>Performance / Parallelism</em>，<code>https://duckdb.org/docs/stable/guides/performance/parallelism</code>）；ClickHouse 的默认 <code>max_block_size</code> 为 65536 行（ClickHouse 文档 <em>Architecture</em>，<code>https://clickhouse.com/docs/en/development/architecture</code>）。差了一个数量级不是随意的：ClickHouse 的块驱动存储层与聚合路径（其架构论文见 <em>ClickHouse — Lightning Fast Analytics for Everyone</em>, VLDB 2024），块越大越利于顺序 I/O 与聚合吞吐；DuckDB 面向嵌入式场景，工作集必须与调用方共享缓存与内存预算，向量取小更保守。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[SQL / 逻辑计划] --&gt; B{执行器形态}&#10;  B --&gt;|进程内嵌入| C[DuckDB&lt;br/&gt;push 流水线 + 自有 Vector 2048 行]&#10;  B --&gt;|编译进调用方| D[Velox&lt;br/&gt;Arrow 兼容算子 + 驱动层]&#10;  B --&gt;|独立服务| E[ClickHouse&lt;br/&gt;MergeTree + 块 65536 行]&#10;  C --&gt; F[自有 Buffer Manager / 列存]&#10;  D --&gt; G[调用方提供存储与内存池]&#10;  E --&gt; H[服务端自有存储与线程池]&#10;  F --&gt; I[结果 / 回写]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[SQL / 逻辑计划] --&gt; B{执行器形态}\n  B --&gt;|进程内嵌入| C[DuckDB&lt;br/&gt;push 流水线 + 自有 Vector 2048 行]\n  B --&gt;|编译进调用方| D[Velox&lt;br/&gt;Arrow 兼容算子 + 驱动层]\n  B --&gt;|独立服务| E[ClickHouse&lt;br/&gt;MergeTree + 块 65536 行]\n  C --&gt; F[自有 Buffer Manager / 列存]\n  D --&gt; G[调用方提供存储与内存池]\n  E --&gt; H[服务端自有存储与线程池]\n  F --&gt; I[结果 / 回写]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"嵌入式-duckdb-的进程内架构\">嵌入式：DuckDB 的进程内架构</h2><p>DuckDB 的选择是把整个分析数据库塞进调用方进程（Raasveldt 与 Mühleisen, <em>DuckDB: an Embeddable Analytical Database</em>, SIGMOD 2019）。这决定了它的三条硬约束。<strong>第一，内存所有权必须可协商</strong>：它不能假设自己独占机器，因此用自有的 Buffer Manager 管理列存块缓存，并暴露内存上限参数给宿主；这也是它的向量尺寸偏小的原因。<strong>第二，并发模型必须与宿主共处</strong>：它使用与硬件线程数相当的固定 worker 池配合 morsel 驱动的动态调度（机制见 <a href=\"../memory-pipeline-vector/morsel-pipeline-parallelism\">Morsel 驱动并行与物化边界</a>），而不是把「进程」当作并行边界。<strong>第三，零外部依赖</strong>：编译出单个库、不引入服务端组件、无需运维——这是它被大量数据科学工具链当默认分析后端采纳的根本原因。</p>\n<p>对选型的影响很直接：当你的部署面是<strong>单机、进程内、数据量在单机内存与本地盘可达范围内</strong>时，嵌入式把「网络往返 + 服务运维 + 序列化」三项成本一次性消掉；代价是你放弃跨机扩展、多租户隔离与统一的集中式观测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库化-velox-的可复用执行层\">库化：Velox 的可复用执行层</h2><p>Velox 走的是相反的抽象路线：它<strong>不提供存储</strong>，只提供「给定一批 Arrow 兼容的列向输入，把算子跑起来」的执行层，由调用方（Presto、Trino、Spark 的 Gluten 加速层等）负责计划、调度与数据源（<em>Velox: Meta&#39;s Unified Execution Engine</em>, VLDB 2022；代码库 <code>https://github.com/facebookincubator/velox</code>）。这意味着 Velox 的核心设计目标是<strong>可嵌入性与可替换性</strong>：类型系统、向量表示、内存池、表达式求值都是稳定的对外接口，存储与网络留在外面。</p>\n<p>库化路线的架构代价集中在三点。<strong>一是内存管理必须外部可注入</strong>：Velox 用内存池层次（memory pool）把分配记账交给调用方，否则多查询共享进程时无法归因与限额。<strong>二是数据类型必须对齐生态</strong>：采用 Arrow 兼容的 <code>FlatVector</code>/<code>DecodedVector</code> 表示，才有希望与既有列式数据源零拷贝衔接。<strong>三是「谁拥有执行循环」必须显式</strong>：Velox 提供驱动（driver）与任务（task）抽象，但并行策略、背压、取消语义由调用方决定——这与 DuckDB 一体化内置并行形成对立。</p>\n<p>选型上，Velox 只在「你已经有一个查询引擎、需要把它的执行层换成向量化实现」的场景才有意义。它是<strong>加速件</strong>而非<strong>数据库</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"服务化-clickhouse-的块式存储耦合架构\">服务化：ClickHouse 的块式存储耦合架构</h2><p>ClickHouse 把存储引擎与执行器深度耦合：数据以 MergeTree 家族的分区/主键/跳数索引组织，扫描天然产出 65536 行的块，后续的过滤、聚合、JOIN 都在这套块接口上做向量化与 SIMD 化。它的架构主张是「为聚合与扫描吞吐做极致优化，接受存储格式即执行约定」。</p>\n<p>这个耦合带来两个结果。<strong>收益</strong>：从磁盘到 SIMD 聚合的整条路径可共同调优——排序键、跳数索引、压缩编码与执行器是同一批人设计的，因此点查与宽表聚合的延迟可预测且低。<strong>代价</strong>：执行器很难脱离它的存储独立使用；数据要进来得先进入它的表结构；跨引擎的算子复用几乎不可能。</p>\n<p>结论是服务化路线的适用面清晰：<strong>多租户、集中式、数据已经或愿意进入它自有存储</strong>的 OLAP 场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选型信号</th>\n<th>倾向 DuckDB</th>\n<th>倾向 Velox</th>\n<th>倾向 ClickHouse</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>部署单元</td>\n<td>进程内 / 单机</td>\n<td>已有引擎内部</td>\n<td>独立集群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需要自带存储</td>\n<td>是（本地/对象存储）</td>\n<td>否（调用方提供）</td>\n<td>是（自有表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要负载</td>\n<td>单机交互式分析、ETL</td>\n<td>替换既有引擎执行层</td>\n<td>高吞吐聚合、日志/指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多租户隔离</td>\n<td>弱（进程内）</td>\n<td>由宿主实现</td>\n<td>强（服务端）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级方式</td>\n<td>依赖升级</td>\n<td>重新编译宿主</td>\n<td>服务端滚动升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观测面</td>\n<td>宿主自建</td>\n<td>宿主自建</td>\n<td>服务端内置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"表达式求值与-jit-向量化与-codegen-的交叉点\">表达式求值与 JIT：向量化与 codegen 的交叉点</h2><p>三个引擎都在「向量化算子树」与「即时编译（JIT/codegen）」之间做了务实取舍。向量化对<strong>算术与比较</strong>这类宽度友好的表达式收益最稳；而表达式数量多、分支多、中间结果需要跨算子融合时，把多个算子编译成一段循环（Neumann, <em>Efficiently Compiling Efficient Query Plans for Modern Hardware</em>, VLDB 2011）能消掉算子间的物化与虚调用。经验上的交叉点是：<strong>表达式越简单、批次越大，向量化越划算；表达式越复杂、算子树越深、选择率越低，codegen 的融合收益越明显</strong>。DuckDB 以向量化为主并对热路径做有限特化，ClickHouse 依赖向量化加手写 SIMD 函数，Velox 则保留 codegen 作为可插能力。选择向量化算子实现与调优手段的更细讨论见 <a href=\"../column-operators-simd/vectorized-operator-implementation\">向量化算子实现</a> 与 <a href=\"../column-operators-simd/simd-operator-tuning-fallback\">SIMD 算子调优与回退</a>。</p>\n<p>一个必须提前决定的架构问题是<strong>选择向量的表示</strong>：是传「紧凑结果列」还是「紧凑数据 + 选择向量（selection vector）」。选择向量让过滤后的批次保持原位、避免拷贝，但会让下游算子失去连续访问，损伤 SIMD 与预取。设选择向量的密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>（被选中行占比），则两种策略的下游成本大致为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sel</mtext></msub><mo>∝</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>scatter</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>compact</mtext></msub><mo>∝</mo><mi>b</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>copy</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>contiguous</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{sel}} \\propto \\rho\\, b \\cdot c_{\\text{scatter}}, \\qquad T_{\\text{compact}} \\propto b\\, c_{\\text{copy}} + \\rho\\, b\\, c_{\\text{contiguous}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">scatter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">compact</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">copy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">contiguous</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 很低时，先做一次紧凑拷贝让下游恢复连续访问通常更划算；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 1 时，选择向量直接透传更省。这条权衡正是 <a href=\"../column-operators-simd/simd-selection-vector-model\">SIMD 选择与向量模型</a> 的核心，也是引擎间行为差异最容易被忽略的一处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>向量化引擎的架构选型可以收敛成三个问题，按顺序问完即可定位：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>引擎跑在哪？</strong> 进程内（DuckDB）、编译进既有引擎（Velox）、独立服务（ClickHouse）。这一问决定了内存所有权、并发模型与运维面，且它比任何性能数字都更少被推翻。</li>\n<li><strong>存储归谁？</strong> 自带存储则可以把「格式—索引—执行器」作为整体调优（ClickHouse、DuckDB）；不自带存储则必须把类型系统与内存池做成可注入接口（Velox）。</li>\n<li><strong>批量与求值策略怎么定？</strong> 批大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 由工作集与尾批次开销的一阶权衡决定（2048 vs 65536 是两个极端端点），表达式求值在「向量化算子树」与「codegen 融合」之间按表达式复杂度取舍，选择向量与紧凑拷贝按选择密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 切换。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>需要强调的是：三者共享同一套下层原理——列向内存布局与编码（见 <a href=\"../memory-pipeline-vector/columnar-memory-layout-encoding\">列存内存布局与编码</a>）、向量化算子、morsel 级并行——差异几乎全部来自「边界划在哪」。因此更换引擎的成本主要不在算法，而在边界两侧的接口：内存记账、调度所有权、数据进出格式。把这三点先想清楚，选型剩下的就只是参数问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"向量化引擎架构与实现选型（DuckDB/Velox/ClickHouse）","id":"向量化引擎架构与实现选型-duckdb-velox-clickhouse"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入式：DuckDB 的进程内架构","id":"嵌入式-duckdb-的进程内架构"},{"level":2,"text":"库化：Velox 的可复用执行层","id":"库化-velox-的可复用执行层"},{"level":2,"text":"服务化：ClickHouse 的块式存储耦合架构","id":"服务化-clickhouse-的块式存储耦合架构"},{"level":2,"text":"表达式求值与 JIT：向量化与 codegen 的交叉点","id":"表达式求值与-jit-向量化与-codegen-的交叉点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"向量缓冲区生命周期、缓存局部性与溢出处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/memory-pipeline-vector/vector-buffer-lifetime-cache"},"next":{"title":"向量化引擎性能剖析与基准度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/engine-implementation-ops/engine-perf-profiling-benchmark"}}